<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Bofors wins ammunition order.</title>
<headline>Swedish Bofors wins ammunition order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Bofors Carl Gustaf AB said on Friday it had received an order for ammunition worth about 130 million crowns from the Swedish defence forces.</p>
<p>The company is a subsidiary of Swedish defence group Celsius AB.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
